<title>NETHERLANDS: VAN MELLE 1996 PROFIT RISES 5.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>VAN MELLE 1996 PROFIT RISES 5.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.98 vs   5.69</p>
<p>    Net profit			    51.1  vs  48.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.10 vs   2.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			     807.9  vs 706.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    67.6  vs  70.5</p>
<p>    Interest income			8.6  vs   0.3</p>
<p>    Tax				     23.4  vs  21.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Sweets maker Van Melle NV said in September it</p>
<p>expected a clearly higher result in 1996 compared to 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
